					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					12.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλλα μοι τὰν Πωλυανάκτιδα παῖδα
					χαίρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					86
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Κύπριν πόλλ᾽ ἐγὼ χαίρειν λέγω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					113
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1059
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				188a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. κελεύων πολλὰ τοὺς Ἀχαρνέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					200
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰπεῖν χαίρειν τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ath.Mitt.</u>
					56.131
				</span></i>
			 (Milet., Hellenistic), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
				50
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίρειν προσαγορεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					322
				</span></i>
