					<u>OT</u>
					363
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ant.</u>
				759
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1299
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				398
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				563
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				510d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γὰπ . . χαίρων τις . . τοὐμὸν
					ἀλγυνεῖ κέαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					90
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε χαίροντες ἂν ἀπαλλάζαιτε</span>”
